  {
   "id": "long-gone-days-31820@major-2017-01-26",
   "gameId": "long-gone-days-31820",
   "displayName": "January 2017 Update",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2017-01-26T02:02:44.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hi everyone,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "First of all, happy 2017 from the Long Gone Days team!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "January is an important month as it marks one year since we started our devlog (link) and our Twitter (@lgdays). We could never have foreseen the amount of things that happened during the last 12 months, but we are working hard everyday to surpass greater milestones.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We haven’t shown a process pic in some time, so here’s one of a pub, where you can see the original sketch, some of the assets, the color balance, etc. Remember you can see more of these in-progress GIFs here.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "QUESTION: What would you like to see in our future updates?",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "As we are making progress in the development, we are working on things that would spoil part of the story, so we’d like to know what kind of things you would like to see on our devlog. We can show more process GIFs and concept art, as well as telling anecdotes about the development.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Until next time!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
   "digest": {
