  {
   "id": "long-gone-days-31820@major-2016-10-14",
   "gameId": "long-gone-days-31820",
   "displayName": "October Update (Development & Upcoming Events)",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2016-10-14T21:47:39.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hi everyone! I hope you have been doing well.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We’ve been working really hard on bringing the game with all its features and HD art to Unity. Also, Nikki has been working on a few surprises we hope to be able to show soon!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Besides that, we’ve been polishing the new party members that will join Rourke and Adair on their journey, and soon they will be ready to make their first official appearance! (Here are some GIFs, but since we are working on the scenes that were seen on the demo, it looks pretty similar, except it’s on a widescreen resolution: Dialogue & Particles)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Upcoming Events",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We’re proud to announce we’ll be part of two events in November!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The first one will be Day of the Devs, (presented by Double Fine and Iam8bit), where we’ll be showing the demo, alongside a bunch of really cool indie games, and it has FREE ADMISSION! The event will be on November 5th in The Midway (San Francisco, CA), so go check it out if you’re near the area.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The other event that we’re gonna be a part of will be GaymerX East, on November 12 and 13 in the Microsoft Technology Center in New York City, where Nikki (Lead Developer) will be showing Long Gone Days at our own table at the Indie Space ◝( ′ㅂ`)و ̑̑",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Until next time!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
